## Wiki — three paths, one source

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| **`scripts/wiki-gitea/`** | Canonical markdown — edit here |
| **`aicom-wiki` satellite** | Publishes to `alexar76/aicom.wiki` on GitHub |
| **`wiki/`** | Local git clones only (`wiki/github/aicom.wiki/`, `wiki/aicom.wiki/`) — **not** pushed to `aicom`, not a satellite |

```bash
./scripts/publish_all_repos.sh --satellite aicom-wiki   # GitHub wiki
./scripts/push-gitea-wiki.sh                            # Gitea wiki (optional)
```

Do not commit contents of `wiki/*` clones — folder is gitignored except `wiki/README.md`.

## language-packs/reputation-dashboard

Not a separate public repo. Legacy root path `language-packs/reputation-dashboard/` is excluded from factory aicom and merged into `aimarket-desktop` at `apps/reputation-dashboard/language-packs/` when mirroring. Prefer canonical path: `desktop-integrations/reputation-dashboard/language-packs/`.

## Idempotency

All publish scripts exit 0 with "already in sync" / "No changes" when remotes match — safe to re-run.
